    },
    "Google licenses its apps and Google Play services only to makers of certified devices. Install apps from files you have; many work without them." : {
      "comment" : "The text of that panel: why (Google licenses its apps and Google Play services only to makers of certified devices) and what to do (install apps from files; many work without these services). The first sentence is the owner's wording; Google stays in Latin letters in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Googleは、自社のアプリとGoogle Play開発者サービスを、認定済みデバイスのメーカーにのみライセンス供与しています。お持ちのファイルからアプリを追加でき、多くはこれらなしで動作します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google仅向认证设备的制造商授权其应用和Google Play服务。你可以用已有的文件安装应用，许多应用不需要这些服务也能使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google只向認證裝置的製造商授權其應用程式和Google Play服務。你可以用手邊的檔案安裝應用程式，許多應用程式不需要這些服務也能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Graphics" : {
