            "value" : "虛擬機器未接受Andarium的密鑰。請重新啟動虛擬機器後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The virtual machine didn’t accept the change. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "The message of the alert shown when the virtual machine did not accept turning Old app compatibility on or off for an app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
