            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虛擬機器尚未準備好。請稍後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The virtual machine needs %@ free to start. Free up space in Settings › General › %@ Storage, or delete snapshots." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The virtual machine needs %1$@ free to start. Free up space in Settings › General › %2$@ Storage, or delete snapshots."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仮想マシンの起動には%1$@の空き容量が必要です。“設定”＞“一般”＞“%2$@ストレージ”で容量を空けるか、スナップショットを削除してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虚拟机启动需要%1$@的可用空间。请在“设置”>“通用”>“%2$@储存空间”中释放空间，或删除快照。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
