    },
    "To install an app, open Settings here and choose Install APK." : {
      "comment" : "Second line of the side keys' tip, shown where Settings has Install APK.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリをインストールするには、ここで“設定”を開き、“APKをインストール”を選択します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要安装应用，请在此打开“设置”，然后选择“安装APK”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要安裝應用程式，請在此打開「設定」，然後選擇「安裝APK」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To start it again, close Andarium in the App Switcher and open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the screen that follows an unexpected end of the virtual machine or the person's Stop on the boot screen, and in Stop's confirmation. The App Switcher is iOS's own; the app has to be closed there, not sent to the Home Screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "もう一度起動するには、AppスイッチャーでAndariumを終了してからもう一度開いてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要重新启动，请在App切换器中关闭Andarium后重新打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "若要重新啟動，請在App切換器中關閉Andarium後重新打開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many messages are waiting for Android to confirm them. Restart Android to send a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Androidの確認を待っているSMSが多すぎます。新しいSMSを送信するには、Androidを再起動してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待Android确认的短信过多。请先重启Android，再发送新短信。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待Android確認的簡訊過多。請先重新啟動Android，再傳送新簡訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold “%@”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
